Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.79,0:00:02.97,main,Female Member,0,0,0,,Today is the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.97,0:00:04.75,main,Chief,0,0,0,,Hm? For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.75,0:00:06.24,main,Female Member,0,0,0,,You have to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:08.72,main,Female member,0,0,0,,It's the day Eden College announces \Nthe admissions results.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.72,0:00:12.20,main,Female Member,0,0,0,,The results should be posted \Nat 1200 hours today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:14.51,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,This is more nerve-racking \Nthan I thought it'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:19.61,main,Yor,0,0,0,,My bracelet just broke. \NWhy did it have to happen today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.61,0:00:21.67,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sure it's just a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:24.16,main,Yor,0,0,0,,L-Loid, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.91,0:00:31.32,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, Yor. Black cats being \Nunlucky is just a superstition.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:33.16,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Y-You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.16,0:00:34.39,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.39,0:00:35.15,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:38.06,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I just stepped in poop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.31,0:00:42.67,main,Chief,0,0,0,,Admissions results for Eden College?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.67,0:00:45.95,main,Chief,0,0,0,,Ah, the thing we've got Agent Twilight doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.95,0:00:51.79,main,Female Member,0,0,0,,Chief, peace between the East \Nand West hangs on Operation Strix.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.79,0:00:53.68,main,Female Member,0,0,0,,Please take this more seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.93,0:00:57.08,main,Chief,0,0,0,,You don't know Twilight very well, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.08,0:00:58.50,main,Female Member,0,0,0,,C-Correct, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.82,0:01:04.71,sign_1411_21_Underwear_,Caption,0,0,0,,{\move(25,260,25,307)}Underwear:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.02,0:01:04.69,main,Chief,0,0,0,,He might just be the best spy in all \Nof Westalis, so don't worry so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:08.05,main,Chief,0,0,0,,He'll be telling us that "the sakura \Nblossoms bloom" soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.05,0:01:09.66,main,Female Member,0,0,0,,What does that mean, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.66,0:01:11.93,main,Chief,0,0,0,,It's a code phrase from the Far East.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.19,0:01:14.06,main,Chief,0,0,0,,It means they passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:16.85,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,It's not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:51.98,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fscx41\pos(475,285)\fad(522,1)}WILL THEY PASS OR FAIL?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.62,0:02:53.80,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,We failed...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.43,0:02:56.61,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,We failed...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.97,0:02:58.48,main,Anya,0,0,0,,We failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:01.75,main,Loid,0,0,0,,L-Let's head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.75,0:03:03.61,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I-I'll make us some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:07.87,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... It's all because I stepped in poop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.87,0:03:10.12,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,A moment, Forgers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.18,0:03:13.74,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Master Henderson...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.48,0:03:17.25,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.54,0:03:19.59,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Look at the very top.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.99,0:03:21.89,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Anya Forger...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.36,0:03:26.38,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,That is the waiting list of successful \Napplicants, though rather confidential.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.02,0:03:28.71,main,Loid,0,0,0,,A waiting list?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.71,0:03:31.93,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Correct. Once her overall scores were tallied,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.93,0:03:35.34,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Anya Forger placed first on that waiting list.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.68,0:03:39.52,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,If any of the current successful \Napplicants were to withdraw,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.52,0:03:41.90,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,she'll immediately get into the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.90,0:03:45.15,main,Loid,0,0,0,,B-But after what we did...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.41,0:03:49.82,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Do you know what the number one killer \Nof our species on this planet is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.82,0:03:50.44,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:52.21,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,It is the mosquito!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.78,0:03:57.16,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Yes. You saved Master Swan from \Nthat brutal killer back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.16,0:03:59.39,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,That brought your score up tremendously.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.69,0:04:01.10,main,Loid,0,0,0,,That's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.10,0:04:02.63,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Stand proud, Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:05.13,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Your family is worthy of our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.13,0:04:09.53,main,Yor,0,0,0,,So if even one person withdraws, \NMiss Anya will get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.53,0:04:10.62,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:13.59,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,But if no one withdraws...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.59,0:04:14.95,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Now, about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.81,0:04:17.38,main,Zachry Feiss,0,0,0,,Th-The Thorn Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:19.10,main,Zachry Feiss,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:21.36,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Secretary Zachry Feiss, I presume?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:24.99,main,Yor,0,0,0,,If it's not too much trouble, \NI will be taking your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.25,0:04:27.12,main,Zachry Feiss,0,0,0,,Please, no! Spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.42,0:04:29.50,main,Zachry Feiss,0,0,0,,I have a son who's just about to turn six!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.50,0:04:32.02,main,Zachry Feiss,0,0,0,,He'll be starting at Eden College next month!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:34.92,main,Zachry Feiss,0,0,0,,If I die, he won't be able to go to school!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.92,0:04:37.42,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry, but that's \Nexactly why I'm doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:37.95,main,Zachry Feiss,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.73,0:04:41.09,main,Yor,0,0,0,,For the sake of Miss Anya \Ngetting into the school...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.81,0:04:43.27,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I need you to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.71,0:04:45.99,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,You mustn't, Yor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.99,0:04:48.91,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,You mustn't take the life \Nof an innocent person, Yor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.91,0:04:49.93,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.21,0:04:52.28,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.28,0:04:54.58,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry, Mr. Zachry Feiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.49,0:04:57.00,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Well, no matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.82,0:05:01.27,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,There are a few that withdraw every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.71,0:05:04.69,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Make sure you are properly \Nprepared for the eventuality.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.08,0:05:07.32,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Master Henderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:13.95,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,I must warn you that I may not be \Nteaching here by the time you arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.95,0:05:14.62,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:18.00,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,I was forced to give that \Nswine a good thrashing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:24.68,top,Henderson,0,0,0,,I was able to protect Eden's honor, \Nbut who know what ramifications await me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.81,0:05:21.53,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,That foolish man and this instructor...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.53,0:05:24.68,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm not sure which one will be \Nmore useful to me in my mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.68,0:05:28.50,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,but if that fool stands in my way, \NI have plenty of ways to destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.88,0:05:31.27,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Please let me know if there's \Nanything I can do to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.70,0:05:35.34,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,I appreciate the attempt at \Nconsolation, my elegant boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.90,0:05:40.31,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Just await that call at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:40.77,sign_8129_90_3_Days_Later,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(65,77)\fad(694,1)}3\NDays\N Later
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.78,0:05:45.92,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya will be accepted... \NAnya will be accepted...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.25,0:05:50.88,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya will be accepted... \NAnya will be accepted...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.73,0:05:50.08,top,Loid,0,0,0,,What in the world is she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:54.24,top,Yor,0,0,0,,Apparently, she's performing a prayer \Ndance to help her get accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.88,0:05:54.48,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya will be accepted...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.24,0:05:56.24,top,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh... I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.48,0:05:56.24,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Kieeeeeeeh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.74,0:06:00.18,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hello, Forger residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.03,0:06:02.82,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.78,0:06:04.49,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.66,0:06:06.92,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.49,0:06:15.78,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Anya got in!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.55,0:06:20.36,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa! I passed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.18,0:06:23.18,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You did a great job, Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.18,0:06:24.20,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:26.63,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness! What wonderful news!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.63,0:06:27.93,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.93,0:06:29.96,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Thank you for all you did as well, Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:35.23,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Heya. I heard she got in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.23,0:06:36.65,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Time to celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.87,0:06:38.23,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You sure found out fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.23,0:06:40.54,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Never underestimate an informant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.54,0:06:42.79,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Oh, you must be the missus. \NPleasure to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.79,0:06:45.25,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I'm Loid's friend, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.25,0:06:46.30,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.30,0:06:47.45,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Scruffy-scruff!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.45,0:06:51.29,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Let's get this party started! I got \Nsome booze, and I ordered delivery!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:53.25,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.25,0:06:57.52,main,Franky,0,0,0,,This is all thanks to me \Nstealing the answer sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.89,0:06:59.47,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You idiot! They'll hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.89,0:07:03.79,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh? Wha wuz zat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:08.25,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Are you even drinking, you party pooper?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.25,0:07:08.98,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Leave me be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:10.61,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Isn't it great, Anya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.61,0:07:13.97,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Daddy said he'll buy you anything \Nas a reward just for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.97,0:07:16.14,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't go promising her things like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.14,0:07:19.12,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I don't want you to buy me anything, \Nbut I wanna do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.36,0:07:20.66,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hm? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.66,0:07:22.49,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I don't mind as long as it's doable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.89,0:07:28.67,italics,Princess Honey,0,0,0,,Save me, Bondman!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.18,0:07:30.98,italics,Commander (TV),0,0,0,,Good morning, Bondman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.98,0:07:36.29,italics,Commander (TV),0,0,0,,Your mission today is to save \Nthe kidnapped Princess Honey,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:37.94,italics,Commander (TV),0,0,0,,and take her back the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.12,0:07:40.34,italics,Bondman,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Princess Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:43.77,italics,TV Narrator,0,0,0,,The kingdom's best spy infiltrates the castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.77,0:07:45.14,italics,TV Narrator,0,0,0,,Bondman!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.42,0:07:47.15,italics,TV Narrator,0,0,0,,Taking down any enemy that stands in his way,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.15,0:07:50.02,italics,TV Narrator,0,0,0,,he finally makes it to the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.02,0:07:52.74,italics,Bondman,0,0,0,,I'm here to save you, Princess Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.74,0:07:54.08,italics,Princess Honey,0,0,0,,Bondman!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.53,0:07:59.43,italics,TV Narrator,0,0,0,,Peace was restored to the castle, \Nand their love continued to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.05,0:07:59.75,top,Anya,0,0,0,,This is what I wanna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:02.89,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What you wanna do? Wait, you mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.11,0:08:06.23,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I wanna play "save Anya from the castle"!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.23,0:08:07.20,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Nope. Not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.38,0:08:12.24,main,Franky,0,0,0,,How cruel... You meanie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:15.29,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I'm not going to school if you don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.56,0:08:16.17,main,Loid,0,0,0,,No one asked you to speak for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.59,0:08:19.30,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Oh, hey. I'm pretty sure that's Newston Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.30,0:08:22.22,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I heard it was recently remodeled \Ninto some cartoon's theme park,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.22,0:08:23.36,main,Franky,0,0,0,,but that's definitely it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.36,0:08:25.85,main,Franky,0,0,0,,It's got the same kinds of \Ntricks and traps seen in the show,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.85,0:08:27.22,main,Franky,0,0,0,,and you can even rent it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.83,0:08:31.54,main,Franky,0,0,0,,The government doesn't have any \Neyes over there, Loidy Boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.54,0:08:34.03,main,Franky,0,0,0,,so it wouldn't hurt to have a little bit of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.03,0:08:35.17,main,Loid,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.17,0:08:37.65,main,Franky,0,0,0,,After everything she went through to pass, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.65,0:08:41.87,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem fair if you can't get \Nsome kind of reward, huh, kiddo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.17,0:08:39.69,top,Anya,0,0,0,,Sniffle, sniffle...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.32,0:08:41.87,top,Anya,0,0,0,,Sniffle, sniffle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.78,0:08:43.80,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Sniffle...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.80,0:08:44.61,main,Loid,0,0,0,,All right, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.83,0:08:46.43,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Right, then! Let's strike while the iron's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.43,0:08:49.81,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Leave the castle reservation to me. \NYou're in charge of our ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.81,0:08:51.51,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Wha?! You expect us to go today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.51,0:08:53.08,main,Loid,0,0,0,,And you want {\i1}me{\i0} to arrange this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.08,0:08:56.24,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Well, of course! It's for your daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.16,0:09:07.60,main,Comms Engineer,0,0,0,,We have a message from Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.09,0:09:10.02,main,Comms Engineer,0,0,0,,Code GO005.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.02,0:09:11.90,main,Female Member,0,0,0,,He did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.90,0:09:13.27,main,Female Member,0,0,0,,"The sakura blossoms bloom."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:15.69,main,Comms Engineer,0,0,0,,Another message from Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.69,0:09:16.46,main,Female Member,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.18,0:09:21.26,main,Comms Engineer,0,0,0,,How shall I reply?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.56,0:09:27.34,flashback,Chief,0,0,0,,He might just be the best \Nspy in all of Westalis...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.51,0:09:29.90,main,Female Member,0,0,0,,Get him what he needs at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:30.76,main,Comms Engineer,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:34.01,main,Comms Engineer,0,0,0,,To Falcon in the Rhynnick region.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.01,0:09:35.42,main,Comms Engineer,0,0,0,,Emergency operation from Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.42,0:09:38.90,italics,Falcon,0,0,0,,Falcon here. Roger the emergency \Noperation from Twilight, over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.81,0:09:43.65,main,Loid,0,0,0,,"1830 hours... Meet downstream on the \NNein River in the Rhynnick region."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.15,0:09:45.93,main,Loid,0,0,0,,They sure didn't waste any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.63,0:09:50.24,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, this castle can do this, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.24,0:09:52.16,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make a quiz!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.16,0:09:54.69,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Hey, great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.69,0:09:57.11,main,Franky,0,0,0,,You seriously came through!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.11,0:10:00.65,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya's never been on a \Nplane before! It's so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.81,0:09:59.96,top,Franky,0,0,0,,Nice, nice, nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.89,0:10:02.16,main,Loid,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.65,0:10:05.13,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Does Anya look cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.13,0:10:06.88,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yes, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.62,0:10:12.55,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid! Where did you get this li'l plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.55,0:10:14.38,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:18.05,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh, some wonderful coworkers of \Nmine are letting me borrow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.57,0:10:21.73,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Fank you for always looking \Nafter my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.67,0:10:27.84,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You all have your seatbelts on? Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.84,0:10:30.14,main,Franky and Anya,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.62,0:10:39.95,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm so excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.47,0:10:44.52,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.58,0:10:50.08,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, it's so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.08,0:10:52.92,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It looks like a tweasure chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:55.05,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa, you're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.41,0:11:01.21,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Look! There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.98,0:11:04.21,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.21,0:11:06.09,main,Anya,0,0,0,,The castle's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.09,0:11:07.79,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey, settle down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.79,0:11:10.38,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We're about to land. \NMake sure you're properly seated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.48,0:11:20.99,main,Anya,0,0,0,,We're in a castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.34,0:11:17.27,top,Loid,0,0,0,,You don't need to go running around with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.27,0:11:19.73,top,Yor,0,0,0,,This is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.00,0:11:24.00,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.34,0:11:25.78,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.78,0:11:27.50,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.50,0:11:30.86,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Can you truly call a castle \Nwith no enemies or servants
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.86,0:11:32.01,main,Anya,0,0,0,,a castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.43,0:11:34.20,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.20,0:11:36.50,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I don't think I can go to school now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.50,0:11:40.50,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I know, right? I can't blame ya, little missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:42.81,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Daddy better step up his game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.81,0:11:44.30,main,Comms Engineer,0,0,0,,We have a report from Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:46.02,main,Comms Engineer,0,0,0,,He's requesting agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.02,0:11:47.46,main,Comms Engineer,0,0,0,,As many as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.62,0:11:50.95,main,Female Member,0,0,0,,This will be a true test for WISE.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.18,0:11:54.72,main,Comms Engineer,0,0,0,,To all agents in Ostania.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.95,0:11:57.99,main,Comms Engineer,0,0,0,,Report to Newston Castle \Nfor an emergency operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.99,0:12:01.66,main,Comms Engineer,0,0,0,,This is an extremely important \Nassignment regarding Operation Strix.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.66,0:12:03.87,main,Comms Engineer,0,0,0,,Mission rank is over SS.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.87,0:12:07.98,main,Comms Engineer,0,0,0,,I repeat: this is an extremely important \Nassignment regarding Operation Strix.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.98,0:12:10.20,main,Comms Engineer,0,0,0,,Mission rank is over SS!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.33,0:12:18.67,main,Agent 3,0,0,0,,That's the real Twilight...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.67,0:12:19.88,main,Agent 4,0,0,0,,I gotta get his autograph later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.44,0:12:22.61,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Look at your agency coming through for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.61,0:12:24.44,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Well, give them the rundown.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.44,0:12:26.33,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I'll explain the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.11,0:12:29.43,main,Loid,0,0,0,,All right, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.21,0:12:37.06,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for gathering \Nhere today on behalf of my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.77,0:12:40.26,italics,Agent 1,0,0,0,,Morse code.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.26,0:12:43.04,italics,Agent 2,0,0,0,,"Just listen quietly."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.04,0:12:44.91,italics,Agent 4,0,0,0,,Orders from Twilight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.91,0:12:48.14,top,Loid,0,0,0,,I would like for all of you to \Nplay the part of the enemies
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.49,0:12:52.50,sign_18354_242_This_assignment_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,310)\fsp.3}This assignment is an imperative part of Operation Strix, and you do not to need to inquire further about it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.14,0:12:49.95,top,Loid,0,0,0,,of a spy who is coming to save a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.20,0:12:52.65,italicstop,Agent 1,0,0,0,,I have absolutely no idea what's going on...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.65,0:12:56.26,italicstop,Agent 2,0,0,0,,But this is Twilight we're talking about. \NI'm sure this is all according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.25,0:13:00.34,sign_18354_242_This_assignment_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,320)\fsp.1\bord1\blur1}This man will explain the details. Follow his orders from now on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.53,0:13:00.49,top,Loid,0,0,0,,Thank you again for doing \Nthis for my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.35,0:13:06.53,main,Franky,0,0,0,,All right! Let's announce the cast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.53,0:13:08.83,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Here's our star for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.59,0:13:11.36,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Princess Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:15.21,main,Anya,0,0,0,,This is the spy person who's gonna save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.82,0:13:16.73,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Loidman!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:18.48,main,Anya,0,0,0,,And the big bad boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.33,0:13:19.79,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Scruffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.48,0:13:19.98,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Count Scruffy Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.49,0:13:22.74,main,Anya,0,0,0,,And Mama... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.18,0:13:24.16,main,Anya,0,0,0,,can be whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.16,0:13:25.14,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.14,0:13:26.63,main,Franky,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.63,0:13:29.44,main,Franky,0,0,0,,to the very capable subordinates \Nof Count Scruffy Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.06,0:13:33.40,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I need you all to put on \Nyour best performances
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.40,0:13:36.21,main,Franky,0,0,0,,and get in Loidman's \Nway as much as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.21,0:13:37.51,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Uh... wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.51,0:13:39.78,italics,Agent 4,0,0,0,,This mission ranking is over SS.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:42.63,italics,Agent 4,0,0,0,,I'll make any sacrifice necessary \Nto see this mission through!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.63,0:13:44.71,italics,Agent 4,0,0,0,,I couldn't ask for a better \Nopponent than Twilight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.98,0:13:46.96,italics,Agent 1,0,0,0,,This day has finally come...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.96,0:13:51.28,main,Franky,0,0,0,,You can all decide for yourselves how \Nyou're going to get in Loidman's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.28,0:13:56.14,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I am not exaggerating when I say the \Nsuccess of this plan is in your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.46,0:13:58.40,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Uh... Where is this going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.40,0:13:59.98,main,Franky,0,0,0,,My loyal minions!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.98,0:14:04.24,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Make Loidman suffer as much as \Npossible for Princess Anya's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.24,0:14:07.89,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Once you're all prepared, \Nget to your positions!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.89,0:14:08.77,main,Agents,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.86,0:14:16.82,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Scruffy, scruffy, scruffy, scruff! \NPrincess Anya is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.82,0:14:19.21,main,Franky,0,0,0,,If you want her back, come after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.21,0:14:20.94,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Save me, Loidman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.94,0:14:22.79,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Wait, it's already started?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.83,0:14:32.65,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.14,0:14:39.27,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Loidman! You are about to face many \Nobstacles in order to get the princess back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:40.25,main,Franky,0,0,0,,First up,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:44.27,main,Franky,0,0,0,,we have a quiz that the princess made \Nup in this courtyard, so listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.27,0:14:47.02,main,Franky,0,0,0,,If you can't answer correctly, \Nyou'll be putting that on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.94,0:14:48.74,main,Loid,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.00,0:14:52.49,main,Franky,0,0,0,,You betcha! A Bondman costume set!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.38,0:14:52.49,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,So exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:55.23,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Okay, question time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.83,0:14:58.86,main,Franky,0,0,0,,What does Princess Anya like about Bondman?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.86,0:15:00.03,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Huh? His face?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.03,0:15:04.08,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Bzzz! The fact that he has \Na pistol with a silencer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.08,0:15:05.29,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What? Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.29,0:15:09.88,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! You're her dad \Nand you don't even know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.58,0:15:11.42,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Next question!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.62,0:15:14.11,main,Franky,0,0,0,,What's Anya's favorite food?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.11,0:15:14.68,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Peanuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.94,0:15:17.00,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Ooh! Correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:19.11,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Tch. Guess that was too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:21.20,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Here's the final question!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.20,0:15:24.27,main,Franky,0,0,0,,If you get it wrong, you'll be \Nchanging into that outfit, Loidman!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.27,0:15:26.20,main,Loid,0,0,0,,That's {\i1}if{\i0} I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:29.27,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Here's your question, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.70,0:15:32.89,main,Franky,0,0,0,,What does Anya want right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.89,0:15:34.71,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What does she want right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.71,0:15:36.88,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Five! Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.88,0:15:38.78,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You didn't say anything about a time limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.78,0:15:40.25,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I never said there wouldn't be one, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:44.62,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Calm down. What does Anya want right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.62,0:15:45.93,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What does she want...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.73,0:15:48.46,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Bondman's spy gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.81,0:15:51.17,main,Franky,0,0,0,,What's the correct answer, Princess Anya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.17,0:15:52.76,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.22,0:15:56.78,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm thirsty, so I'd like some water, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.78,0:15:59.57,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Looks like you're wrong, Loidman!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:16:00.69,top,Loid,0,0,0,,How the hell would I know that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.57,0:16:01.24,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Scruffy, scruffy, scruffy, scruff!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.24,0:16:03.43,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Too bad for you, Loidman!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.66,0:16:06.19,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Now, let's have you keep your word!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.20,0:16:10.11,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm {\i1}so{\i0} excited...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.11,0:16:13.44,main,Anya,0,0,0,,to see the {\i1}real{\i0} Loidman!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.39,0:16:28.96,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Loidman!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.96,0:16:31.11,main,Franky,0,0,0,,All right, then! On to the next stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.11,0:16:32.54,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.77,0:16:54.36,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Loidman!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.36,0:16:58.07,main,Franky,0,0,0,,If you want to save Princess Anya, \Nyou'll have to make your way up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:17:00.87,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Scruffy, scruffy, scruffy, scruff!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.59,0:17:05.01,main,Agent 4,0,0,0,,He's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.47,0:17:32.77,main,Agent 4,0,0,0,,He's just so amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.77,0:17:35.37,main,Anya,0,0,0,,You're so cool, Loidman!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.37,0:17:37.06,main,Franky,0,0,0,,We're just getting started, scruff!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.75,0:17:40.06,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.06,0:17:41.15,main,Loid,0,0,0,,God, this is pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:45.24,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Loidman! Up here, up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.34,0:17:47.91,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.98,0:18:00.35,main,Loid,0,0,0,,There's no end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.40,0:18:21.18,main,Anya,0,0,0,,This is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.18,0:18:23.61,main,Franky,0,0,0,,You've got this, my minions! \NDon't let him win!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.61,0:18:25.55,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Loid! Let them hit you, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.08,0:18:34.27,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Now you've done it, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.27,0:18:36.67,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Don't think you're gonna catch us that easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.50,0:18:44.05,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Buh-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.05,0:18:46.53,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Save me, Loidman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.03,0:19:00.04,main,Anya,0,0,0,,You're so amazing, Loidman!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.15,0:19:16.26,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Scruffy, scruffy, scruffy, scruff! \NI'm impressed you got this far, Loidman!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.26,0:19:18.01,main,Franky,0,0,0,,But I won't let you have the princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.56,0:19:22.58,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Save me, Loidman!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:29.89,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Are you seriously telling me \NI have to act out this embarrassing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.89,0:19:31.48,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,little play in front of all of these agents?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.12,0:19:34.82,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,But in the end... this is for the mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.58,0:19:39.54,main,Loid,0,0,0,,H... Hand over the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.54,0:19:40.45,main,Agents,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.45,0:19:43.44,main,Agent 4,0,0,0,,I can't believe we get to see \NTwilight's acting skills in person!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.49,0:19:48.37,main,Franky,0,0,0,,You fool! You think I'd \Nhand her over that easily?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:53.36,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Now, go! The most powerful \Nwitch in the world, Yorticia!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.36,0:19:55.45,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Finish off that fool, scruff!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.90,0:19:57.25,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Now there's a witch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.25,0:19:59.01,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on in this story?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.19,0:20:05.77,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.77,0:20:07.95,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Wai—no way. What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.95,0:20:12.23,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Anyone who tries to kidnap Miss Anya...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.79,0:20:14.36,main,Yor,0,0,0,,will not get away alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.36,0:20:16.58,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Y-Yor, please calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.92,0:20:21.32,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Why is she using physical \Nattacks when she's a witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.02,0:20:28.17,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,She's strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.17,0:20:29.32,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,She's gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.20,0:20:38.45,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor... Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.02,0:20:46.94,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Scruffy, scruffy, scruffy, scruff!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.94,0:20:49.72,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Excellent work getting this far, Loidman!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.01,0:20:52.69,main,Franky,0,0,0,,But you won't defeat me that easil—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.80,0:20:56.06,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,So exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:21:01.10,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I... I've come to save you, Princess Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.14,0:21:05.71,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.71,0:21:07.85,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Wait... I'm supposed to be your dad in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.06,0:21:21.74,main,Anya,0,0,0,,So sparkly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.68,0:21:28.05,main,Agent 1,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.66,0:21:31.26,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Anya...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.16,0:21:34.21,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Congratulations...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.11,0:21:38.34,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.98,0:21:43.24,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I've had so much excitement \Never since I left the orphanage!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.24,0:21:44.65,main,Anya,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.65,0:21:47.07,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hm? Oh... I'm happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.02,0:21:50.45,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm gonna do my best in school!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.45,0:21:54.32,main,Loid,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.45,0:22:00.22,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Well, anyway... congratulations \Non getting into the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.48,0:22:16.60,main,Female member,0,0,0,,Sir, the expense report from Agent Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.94,0:22:20.73,main,Chief,0,0,0,,Are these numbers real?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.73,0:22:22.21,main,Female member,0,0,0,,Yes, they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.21,0:22:22.94,main,Chief,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.94,0:22:23.68,main,Female member,0,0,0,,They are correct.
